{"id":"258c3795028ee0ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md","title":"Complete Boolean Algebra","display":"df-complete-boolean — Complete Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complete-boolean","aliases":["58-df-complete-boolean"],"display":"df-complete-boolean — Complete Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complete-boolean"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complete-boolean</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-boolean — Complete Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,\\vee,\\wedge,\\neg,0,1\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb B,\\vee,\\wedge,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge s=x)\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge u=x))\\to s\\wedge u=s)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge s=x)\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge u=x))\\to s\\wedge u=s)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete Boolean algebras have all suprema and infima.</li>\n<li>They are the algebraic form of forcing notions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B,\\vee,\\wedge,\\neg,0,1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge s=x)\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\wedge u=x))\\to s\\wedge u=s)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"62bd0ea842ce3981","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})$ (see [[58-df-complete-boolean]])"},{"id":"52abdd87e34f04ed","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S$ is the six-place predicate from [[58-df-complete-boolean.md]]"},{"id":"4faa581656027a13","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md]])"},{"id":"3d83d56c75f26def","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md|58-df-complete-boolean]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a5e10857074b912e"]}